WEBVTT

00:04.480 --> 00:08.480
<b>KAMIYA KASSHIN-RYU</b>

00:06.650 --> 00:08.480
<b>It's been once week now.</b>

00:09.150 --> 00:12.070
<b>The crossroad killings case
has been resolved, too.</b>

00:13.400 --> 00:15.740
<b>But none of my students have returned!</b>

00:16.240 --> 00:17.870
<b>Agh! It's so irritating!</b>

00:18.280 --> 00:20.870
<b>We are in an era of enlightenment,
that we are.</b>

00:21.000 --> 00:25.000
<b>Once you leave, it's quite
difficult to return, that it is.</b>

00:25.500 --> 00:26.790
<b>And speaking of irritating...</b>

00:26.790 --> 00:27.960
<b>your age, Kenshin!</b>

00:28.630 --> 00:31.050
<b>You look like that,
but you're 28 years old?</b>

00:31.050 --> 00:32.670
<b>That's a lie! A con job!</b>

00:32.840 --> 00:35.470
<b>That's way too young
to be a previous Imperialist, too!</b>

00:36.550 --> 00:39.180
<b>Then would it be all right
if I was over 30, would it?</b>

00:41.560 --> 00:42.680
<b>I don't want that, either.</b>

00:43.100 --> 00:44.980
<b>You are so selfish, that you are.</b>

02:15.990 --> 02:19.990
<b>TOKYO SAMURAI -
YAHIKO MYOJIN</b>

02:22.740 --> 02:24.620
<b>But, well, there's no use in fretting.</b>

02:25.120 --> 02:27.580
<b>The students will come back in due time,
that they will.</b>

02:28.000 --> 02:31.000
<b>But even to practice, there's nobody here.</b>

02:31.000 --> 02:32.670
<b>That's why I have to head out</b>

02:32.670 --> 02:34.840
<b>to an acquaintance's dojo like this
to practice!</b>

02:35.210 --> 02:37.460
<b>Because you won't even look my way!</b>

02:37.970 --> 02:40.970
<b>Oh, no, I just can't
get used to bamboo swords.</b>

02:42.260 --> 02:43.100
<b>Oro?</b>

02:43.600 --> 02:44.560
<b>Wait up!</b>

02:45.260 --> 02:47.100
<b>Kenshin, this kid is a pickpocket!</b>

02:47.390 --> 02:49.390
<b>This is your wallet, isn't it?</b>

02:49.390 --> 02:51.480
<b>Damn it! Let me go, you ugly hag!</b>

02:51.480 --> 02:52.310
<b>Ug—</b>

02:52.310 --> 02:56.360
<b>How rude! People around here
call me the swordsmanship sweetheart!</b>

02:56.360 --> 02:57.690
<b>Shut up, ugly hag!</b>

02:57.690 --> 02:59.400
<b>- There, there.
- You've said it again!</b>

02:59.400 --> 03:02.070
<b>Nothing I can do about it
if I was pickpocketed, that I can't.</b>

02:59.450 --> 03:01.490
<b>- It's the truth, ain't it?
- What?</b>

03:03.240 --> 03:05.530
<b>Kiddo, don't get caught next time.</b>

03:05.990 --> 03:07.830
<b>Now, let's be on our way, that we should.</b>

03:08.370 --> 03:09.750
<b>Hold it. Wait, Kenshin!</b>

03:16.710 --> 03:17.590
<b>Oro!</b>

03:17.920 --> 03:19.800
<b>I ain't no kid!</b>

03:19.800 --> 03:22.180
<b>I'm a descendant of a Tokyo samurai,
Yahiko Myojin!</b>

03:22.680 --> 03:25.180
<b>I haven't sunk so low
as to be pitied by others!</b>

03:25.470 --> 03:27.180
<b>I simply pulled a prank on you</b>

03:27.180 --> 03:30.140
<b>'cause you've got the nerve
to be wearing a sword!</b>

03:30.640 --> 03:32.850
<b>Don't get me wrong, you punk!</b>

03:35.610 --> 03:36.770
<b>Kiddo...</b>

03:36.770 --> 03:38.440
<b>I told ya, I ain't no kid!</b>

03:39.490 --> 03:42.450
<b>You still have the guise of a child,</b>

03:42.450 --> 03:44.820
<b>but your heart can stand its own ground,
that it can.</b>

03:46.030 --> 03:48.790
<b>Apologies. I had underestimated you.</b>

03:54.460 --> 03:56.710
<b>What a cheeky one!</b>

04:15.940 --> 04:18.690
<b>Tokyo really is a rowdy place, that it is.</b>

04:19.190 --> 04:22.150
<b>Kenshin, where were you
before you came here?</b>

04:22.360 --> 04:24.530
<b>Well, I was randomly here and there.</b>

04:24.530 --> 04:26.120
<b>I am a rurouni after all, that I am.</b>

04:27.700 --> 04:30.370
<b><i>I wonder why he spends his days
as a rurouni?</i></b>

04:33.500 --> 04:37.080
<b><i>Most Imperialists have
long since abandoned their swords</i></b>

04:37.460 --> 04:40.460
<b><i>and have taken on honorable duties
with the Meiji government,</i></b>

04:40.460 --> 04:42.510
<b><i>abusing their authority.</i></b>

04:44.180 --> 04:46.590
<b>You look like you want to ask a question,
that it does.</b>

04:46.590 --> 04:47.510
<b>Huh?</b>

04:49.930 --> 04:50.970
<b><i>It's all right.</i></b>

04:50.970 --> 04:53.890
<b><i>It's not surprising for anyone
to have one or two tales of the past</i></b>

04:53.890 --> 04:55.690
<b><i>that they don't want to tell anyone about.</i></b>

04:57.560 --> 04:58.940
<b>It's nothing, really!</b>

04:58.940 --> 05:01.360
<b>Anyway, that sword!</b>

05:01.360 --> 05:03.240
<b>I told you to hide it with something!</b>

05:03.360 --> 05:07.110
<b>Now, now. As recent as two years ago,
many carried swords, you know.</b>

05:07.620 --> 05:10.950
<b>See? Nobody really seems to care,
that they don't.</b>

05:10.950 --> 05:13.200
<b>But someone just meddled with you!</b>

05:13.200 --> 05:15.250
<b>There are a lot
of police officers in town, too.</b>

05:15.250 --> 05:18.000
<b>Even if it's a sakabato,
they are sure to arrest you!</b>

05:18.000 --> 05:20.250
<b>I'll deal with it if it comes to that,
that I will.</b>

05:21.050 --> 05:22.340
<b>Sheesh.</b>

05:24.840 --> 05:27.130
<b>I'm going to head out for practice now.</b>

05:27.130 --> 05:28.800
<b>So, Kenshin, please go shopping for me.</b>

05:29.220 --> 05:31.060
<b>Get some miso, salt, and soy sauce.</b>

05:31.060 --> 05:32.770
<b>They're all so heavy.</b>

05:32.770 --> 05:34.020
<b>No complaints!</b>

05:47.660 --> 05:49.370
<b>Sorry to ask from a carriage.</b>

05:49.660 --> 05:53.950
<b>Is this the right road
to go to the police station?</b>

05:53.950 --> 05:55.910
<b>O-Oh, yes.</b>

05:56.410 --> 05:59.580
<b>Head to the end of the street,
and turn right at the boulevard.</b>

05:59.580 --> 06:00.540
<b>Thank you.</b>

06:01.040 --> 06:03.170
<b>You heard her. Hurry over.</b>

06:06.800 --> 06:08.510
<b>That was an amazing carriage.</b>

06:07.930 --> 06:11.510
<b>I haven't seen that face in this town.
Who was that?</b>

06:08.510 --> 06:10.050
<b>I've never seen anything like it!</b>

06:10.050 --> 06:11.510
<b>Where is that rich guy from?</b>

06:13.260 --> 06:14.640
<b><i>Really?</i></b>

06:15.140 --> 06:17.940
<b><i>Are you really here in this town?</i></b>

06:18.980 --> 06:20.900
<b><i>Himura Battosai...</i></b>

06:26.110 --> 06:27.950
<b>Hey, Yahiko.</b>

06:27.950 --> 06:30.360
<b>Your payment is due today.</b>

06:30.360 --> 06:32.620
<b>You have it ready, don't you?</b>

06:33.280 --> 06:34.240
<b>Not yet.</b>

06:34.240 --> 06:35.080
<b>Huh?</b>

06:35.330 --> 06:38.040
<b>Shut up! You can't complain
if I get it ready by this evening—</b>

06:40.370 --> 06:41.880
<b>M-Mr. Gaskeh...</b>

06:45.840 --> 06:48.760
<b>Don't you be mockin' me, you stupid brat.</b>

06:49.260 --> 06:54.930
<b>Listen. When you bring me no money,
you're absolutely worthless.</b>

06:56.930 --> 06:58.850
<b>I'll drop by again in the evening.</b>

06:58.850 --> 07:02.020
<b>If you got no money then,
this won't be the end of it.</b>

07:05.230 --> 07:06.440
<b>Got that?</b>

07:14.330 --> 07:16.410
<b>It's a bit rowdy over there.</b>

07:17.370 --> 07:19.370
<b>Hold on! Did something happen?</b>

07:19.370 --> 07:20.710
<b>An arrest!</b>

07:20.710 --> 07:23.830
<b>A cop is chasing after someone
in violation of the Sword Abolishment Act!</b>

07:29.510 --> 07:31.130
<b>What a restless man!</b>

07:31.260 --> 07:32.890
<b>Just give up, already!</b>

07:32.890 --> 07:35.680
<b>Hmm. They're really tenacious,
that they are.</b>

07:37.560 --> 07:38.390
<b>That guy...</b>

07:39.180 --> 07:42.900
<b>I have no choice.
I guess I will calmly be apprehended.</b>

07:42.900 --> 07:44.020
<b>Out of the way!</b>

07:44.770 --> 07:46.940
<b>The Sword Bearing Police
can't get through!</b>

07:46.940 --> 07:48.610
<b>If you don't move, we'll cut you apart!</b>

08:00.750 --> 08:02.710
<b>L-Lieutenant Ujiki.</b>

08:03.460 --> 08:06.420
<b>Good work.
Our squad will take care of the rest.</b>

08:07.000 --> 08:08.630
<b>You guys can leave now.</b>

08:08.630 --> 08:13.010
<b>H-However, this man doesn't show
any intention of drawing his sword.</b>

08:13.010 --> 08:15.260
<b>And we have already surrounded him,
as you can see.</b>

08:15.510 --> 08:17.720
<b>We don't need to trouble
the Sword Bearing Police—</b>

08:19.680 --> 08:22.180
<b>A third-class officer dares
to have an opinion against me,</b>

08:22.180 --> 08:24.690
<b>a Satsuma Revolutionary warrior?</b>

08:25.310 --> 08:27.520
<b>When I say get lost,
hurry up, and get lost.</b>

08:29.690 --> 08:32.650
<b>How about you draw your sword, pansy?</b>

08:33.200 --> 08:35.950
<b>Since you're carrying your sword
here in Tokyo,</b>

08:35.950 --> 08:38.120
<b>you must be confident in your skills.</b>

08:38.530 --> 08:41.910
<b>I don't have a sword that I draw
anywhere and everywhere, that I don't.</b>

08:42.620 --> 08:45.670
<b>In the first place, I don't carry a sword</b>

08:45.670 --> 08:47.710
<b>in order to brandish my strength,
that I don't.</b>

08:50.130 --> 08:51.380
<b>Kenshin!</b>

08:52.840 --> 08:55.300
<b>She's with you, right?</b>

08:55.300 --> 08:56.510
<b>Miss Kaoru, stay away!</b>

09:02.600 --> 09:05.640
<b>With the next strike, I will slash
her kimono apart and humiliate her.</b>

09:06.270 --> 09:07.610
<b>I will say it again.</b>

09:08.110 --> 09:09.980
<b>How about you draw your sword?</b>

09:11.360 --> 09:12.530
<b>Are you...</b>

09:13.240 --> 09:15.240
<b>really a police officer, you are?</b>

09:15.450 --> 09:16.280
<b>Yeah.</b>

09:16.700 --> 09:19.950
<b>With permission to carry a sword,
I can legally slay men.</b>

09:20.450 --> 09:22.200
<b>I'm with the Sword Bearing Police.</b>

09:22.200 --> 09:24.870
<b>Don't push your luck
just 'cause you're a government official!</b>

09:24.870 --> 09:26.000
<b>So oppressive!</b>

09:26.000 --> 09:27.170
<b>Enough of that, you thug!</b>

09:28.750 --> 09:31.920
<b>What nerve for you to insult me.</b>

09:31.920 --> 09:34.130
<b>Apply the crime
of resisting a government official.</b>

09:34.630 --> 09:36.340
<b>Arrest every last one of them.</b>

09:36.550 --> 09:37.760
<b>Authorizing usage of swords!</b>

09:38.800 --> 09:41.220
<b>Don't worry about those that resist.</b>

09:41.220 --> 09:42.060
<b>Slay them.</b>

09:49.360 --> 09:50.690
<b>Against Miss Kaoru...</b>

09:51.230 --> 09:52.650
<b>or the townsfolk...</b>

09:53.400 --> 09:55.650
<b>not an inch of that blade will touch them!</b>

09:57.030 --> 09:59.950
<b>If you want an opponent,
I will take you on.</b>

10:01.200 --> 10:04.660
<b>You finally fell
for the provocation, pansy.</b>

10:05.370 --> 10:08.040
<b>That sakabato is quite a strange blade...</b>

10:08.540 --> 10:10.630
<b>but now I can kill
in the name of self-defense.</b>

10:13.710 --> 10:19.510
<b>A swordsman needs to slay a man
every so often to keep his senses sharp.</b>

10:24.430 --> 10:25.350
<b>Kenshin!</b>

10:27.020 --> 10:30.020
<b>RUROUNI KENSHIN</b>

10:30.020 --> 10:34.480
<b>CHIEF'S OFFICE</b>

10:30.650 --> 10:33.610
<b>I see. So it was a fake.</b>

10:33.610 --> 10:34.480
<b>Yes.</b>

10:34.730 --> 10:37.950
<b>I was busy with the aftermath
of the Seinan War,</b>

10:37.950 --> 10:40.660
<b>and I couldn't
drop by like this until today.</b>

10:40.660 --> 10:43.860
<b>But if I had given it some thought,
I should have been able to figure it out.</b>

10:43.860 --> 10:47.120
<b>Himura is a man
that never wielded such an evil sword.</b>

10:48.120 --> 10:52.670
<b>Indeed, he has slain enough people
to be called Hitokiri Battosai.</b>

10:53.250 --> 10:57.340
<b>But not once did he slay a man
for his own self-interests.</b>

10:57.840 --> 11:00.760
<b>It was all for Meiji, the new era.</b>

11:01.180 --> 11:05.430
<b>A hero who saved the lives of many
Revolutionary warriors with his sword.</b>

11:06.310 --> 11:09.850
<b>Without him, the revolution
would never have succeeded.</b>

11:13.360 --> 11:15.190
<b>I wanted to find and welcome him</b>

11:15.190 --> 11:19.400
<b>as a high-ranking officer
of our Imperial Ground Troops.</b>

11:19.400 --> 11:21.820
<b>About that, actually,
the perpetrators were dropped off...</b>

11:22.280 --> 11:26.160
<b>in front of the station
early in the morning,</b>

11:26.160 --> 11:28.790
<b>so we still have no idea
who apprehended them.</b>

11:29.370 --> 11:32.580
<b>But upon inquiry, those guys mentioned
that "the real deal got us."</b>

11:32.790 --> 11:33.790
<b>What?</b>

11:33.790 --> 11:37.340
<b>Well, I'm sure it's nonsense
from untrustworthy bandits.</b>

11:38.920 --> 11:40.300
<b>We have a problem, Chief!</b>

11:40.550 --> 11:43.470
<b>You idiot! I have a guest here!
Knock before entering, at the least!</b>

11:43.800 --> 11:47.470
<b>I'm terribly sorry!
However, the Sword Bearing Police...</b>

11:47.470 --> 11:50.390
<b>Ujiki caused yet another scene, did he?</b>

11:50.890 --> 11:54.020
<b>Sword Bearing Police?
I've never heard of them.</b>

11:54.270 --> 11:57.440
<b>Yes. It's a squad created
through orders from the head office</b>

11:57.440 --> 12:00.240
<b>to deal with the current incident.</b>

12:00.610 --> 12:02.450
<b>But they are all ruffians,</b>

12:02.450 --> 12:05.410
<b>and their captain
is from Satsuma and is...</b>

12:05.950 --> 12:07.990
<b>well, an Imperialist.</b>

12:07.990 --> 12:09.700
<b>He's a bit too much for me to handle...</b>

12:11.000 --> 12:13.750
<b><i>Imperialists were generally categorized
into five groups</i></b>

12:13.750 --> 12:15.540
<b><i>based on where they were born...</i></b>

12:15.540 --> 12:23.970
<b>TOSA</b>

12:15.540 --> 12:23.970
<b>HIZEN</b>

12:15.540 --> 12:23.970
<b>SATSUMA</b>

12:15.540 --> 12:23.970
<b>CHOSHU</b>

12:15.920 --> 12:19.460
<b><i>Satsuma, Choshu, Tosa, Hizen,</i></b>

12:19.460 --> 12:21.840
<b><i>and others, such as Mito and Fukuoka.</i></b>

12:22.340 --> 12:23.970
<b><i>Among them, Satsuma and Choshu</i></b>

12:23.970 --> 12:27.680
<b><i>long served as two great factions
of the Meiji government.</i></b>

12:28.310 --> 12:30.890
<b><i>At this time,
Satsuma's authority in the police</i></b>

12:30.890 --> 12:35.440
<b><i>and Choshu's authority in the military
were absolute.</i></b>

12:36.690 --> 12:40.650
<b>I see. Someone from Satsuma
that is a Revolutionary warrior.</b>

12:40.650 --> 12:42.440
<b>You can't do anything about his impudence.</b>

12:43.650 --> 12:46.240
<b>So, what did he do this time?</b>

12:46.740 --> 12:48.740
<b>Oh... actually, um...</b>

12:49.030 --> 12:53.080
<b>he's been defeated.
Just by one swordsman, even.</b>

12:53.370 --> 12:55.080
<b>What? Impossible!</b>

12:55.080 --> 12:58.040
<b>The Sword Bearing Police
are the elites of this station!</b>

12:58.250 --> 12:59.840
<b>But that's the truth.</b>

13:00.340 --> 13:02.170
<b>I don't believe it.</b>

13:02.170 --> 13:04.510
<b>Who in the world is this man?</b>

13:04.510 --> 13:05.760
<b>I don't know.</b>

13:06.180 --> 13:10.350
<b>He was a soft-looking fellow,
short and thin, with red hair...</b>

13:11.180 --> 13:14.350
<b>and his swordsmanship was lightning quick.</b>

13:14.940 --> 13:17.400
<b>That's right, if I recall correctly,</b>

13:17.400 --> 13:19.520
<b>he had a huge cross-shaped scar
on his left cheek!</b>

13:21.150 --> 13:22.320
<b><i>It can't be...</i></b>

13:25.570 --> 13:27.450
<b>H-He's strong.</b>

13:28.780 --> 13:32.080
<b>Damn you. We were going easy on you,
as you were outnumbered.</b>

13:32.080 --> 13:33.540
<b>Don't get conceited!</b>

13:33.870 --> 13:35.920
<b>Here comes Sekirei Itto-ryu!</b>

13:36.250 --> 13:38.420
<b>Eat my Yajyu Shishikage-ryu!</b>

13:38.420 --> 13:40.590
<b>Brace for Shindou Kinen-ryu!</b>

13:51.350 --> 13:52.810
<b>One left.</b>

13:53.430 --> 13:54.980
<b>One more! Get him!</b>

13:54.980 --> 13:57.810
<b>What was that about Sword Bearing Police?
Beat 'em up!</b>

13:58.060 --> 14:02.900
<b>Swear to the townsfolk that you won't
be oppressive to them, that you will...</b>

14:03.570 --> 14:05.490
<b>and things end right there.</b>

14:06.070 --> 14:08.740
<b>Afterwards, you can arrest me as you wish.</b>

14:08.950 --> 14:12.200
<b>Give me a break!
I can't do something so pathetic!</b>

14:13.160 --> 14:14.200
<b>That stance...</b>

14:15.410 --> 14:17.160
<b>the most powerful sword in Satsuma,
Jigen-ryu,</b>

14:17.160 --> 14:18.710
<b>known for not needing a second strike!</b>

14:19.210 --> 14:20.080
<b>Stop it, Ujiki.</b>

14:20.330 --> 14:21.630
<b>That man is—</b>

14:21.630 --> 14:23.460
<b>A foolish man.</b>

14:23.460 --> 14:26.380
<b>Indeed, Jigen-ryu is a powerful sword
with no parallel.</b>

14:26.380 --> 14:28.430
<b>Chesto!</b>

14:28.430 --> 14:29.260
<b>However...</b>

14:29.720 --> 14:34.220
<b>facing Hiten Mitsurugi-ryu,
it is all but meaningless.</b>

14:43.270 --> 14:44.110
<b>Kenshin!</b>

14:44.940 --> 14:46.280
<b>Are you not hurt, that you are?</b>

14:46.740 --> 14:48.740
<b>- Oro?
- That was amazing, man!</b>

14:48.740 --> 14:50.240
<b>Hey, where are you from, swordsman?</b>

14:50.240 --> 14:51.700
<b>Have a drink with us!</b>

14:53.950 --> 14:54.870
<b>Himura!</b>

14:56.950 --> 14:58.960
<b>I am finally able to meet you.</b>

14:59.540 --> 15:01.420
<b>I've been looking for you
for 10 years now.</b>

15:01.920 --> 15:05.210
<b>So you decided to grow a mustache,
Mr. Yamagata.</b>

15:05.210 --> 15:08.470
<b><i>Huh? Yamagata? Can he be...</i></b>

15:08.510 --> 15:10.630
<b><i>the general of the Kiheitai,</i></b>

15:10.630 --> 15:12.390
<b><i>the most powerful army
of the revolution,</i></b>

15:12.390 --> 15:14.760
<b><i>and the current army general
of the Meiji government.</i></b>

15:14.760 --> 15:17.430
<b><i>Imperialist Aritomo Yamagata!</i></b>

15:18.310 --> 15:20.440
<b>Chief, clear the area.</b>

15:20.440 --> 15:21.270
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

15:21.480 --> 15:23.020
<b>Come on! Shoo! Shoo!</b>

15:23.020 --> 15:24.900
<b>What? You're being oppressive!</b>

15:24.900 --> 15:26.230
<b>Later, mister!</b>

15:26.530 --> 15:28.690
<b>I have a carriage waiting over there.</b>

15:29.400 --> 15:33.660
<b>Many Revolutionary warriors
are eagerly awaiting your return.</b>

15:34.990 --> 15:35.830
<b>Now...</b>

15:40.790 --> 15:42.040
<b>I'm sorry, but...</b>

15:43.130 --> 15:47.550
<b>I have no intent on serving honorably
as someone who slays other people.</b>

15:48.460 --> 15:50.880
<b>What are you saying?
Even though you killed,</b>

15:50.880 --> 15:53.680
<b>that was a splendid piece
of the great Revolution!</b>

15:54.220 --> 15:57.390
<b>Indeed, some do show disdain
and call you a manslayer!</b>

15:57.390 --> 15:59.100
<b>And those that do, I will personally—</b>

15:59.100 --> 16:01.390
<b>Force them to yield
as a government official.</b>

16:02.730 --> 16:07.650
<b>Egotism of that nature is what lets
guys like that do whatever they want.</b>

16:08.400 --> 16:11.280
<b>It wasn't for honorable duty
as a government official or for power.</b>

16:11.650 --> 16:14.620
<b>We took our swords and fought</b>

16:14.620 --> 16:18.330
<b>to create and protect a world
where people can live happily.</b>

16:18.790 --> 16:24.710
<b>If you forget that, Mr. Yamagata,
we are nothing more than simple upstarts.</b>

16:30.970 --> 16:32.260
<b>But, Himura!</b>

16:32.550 --> 16:34.220
<b>Times have changed!</b>

16:34.220 --> 16:35.970
<b>We are in a new era, Meiji!</b>

16:36.180 --> 16:39.180
<b>The Sword Abolishment Act is in effect,
and the samurai have perished!</b>

16:39.180 --> 16:42.350
<b>This is different from the Bakumatsu Era,
where swords spoke the loudest!</b>

16:42.350 --> 16:46.440
<b>Without the power of government officials
in this Meiji Era,</b>

16:46.440 --> 16:48.440
<b>you can't do anything with just one sword!</b>

16:51.490 --> 16:53.110
<b>Even with just one sword...</b>

16:56.120 --> 17:01.330
<b>at least I can somehow protect those
that catch my eye, that I can.</b>

17:03.000 --> 17:05.750
<b>I have never changed, past or present,
that I haven't.</b>

17:06.580 --> 17:10.090
<b>Outside of a Hitokiri
turning into a rurouni.</b>

17:17.640 --> 17:18.470
<b>Chief...</b>

17:18.970 --> 17:22.390
<b>I know. One look
at the reaction from the townsfolk</b>

17:22.390 --> 17:24.850
<b>makes it obvious who was in the wrong.</b>

17:25.440 --> 17:28.400
<b>And his sword is even safer
than those sword-canes.</b>

17:29.020 --> 17:30.190
<b>I will overlook this case.</b>

17:30.690 --> 17:31.820
<b>Apologies.</b>

17:32.070 --> 17:35.030
<b>However, with the imposter case and all,</b>

17:35.030 --> 17:36.360
<b>I had been under the assumption</b>

17:36.360 --> 17:39.780
<b>that Hitokiri Battosai was
an evil, dangerous individual.</b>

17:41.410 --> 17:44.250
<b>But the real one
indeed is a lot different.</b>

17:47.080 --> 17:49.710
<b>I'm sorry, Miss Kaoru, that I am.</b>

17:49.710 --> 17:50.750
<b>About what?</b>

17:51.090 --> 17:52.340
<b>About the ribbon, that is.</b>

17:52.840 --> 17:55.380
<b>It got ruined because of me.</b>

17:56.760 --> 18:00.970
<b>It's fine. As long as you work hard
on your chores in return.</b>

18:01.760 --> 18:03.560
<b>For starters, you can go shopping.</b>

18:03.560 --> 18:05.180
<b>You haven't gone yet after all, right?</b>

18:05.480 --> 18:08.900
<b>And when you get back, you have to bring
all the dried laundry back inside.</b>

18:13.820 --> 18:18.530
<b><i>I think I understood just a little bit
on why Kenshin is a rurouni.</i></b>

18:20.370 --> 18:25.290
<b><i>To be unhindered by anything and
to freely protect people with his sword,</i></b>

18:26.250 --> 18:28.710
<b><i>he lives with the flow.</i></b>

18:28.710 --> 18:30.880
<b><i>That's why he's a wanderer.</i></b>

18:39.300 --> 18:42.140
<b><i>You still have the guise of a child,</i></b>

18:42.140 --> 18:44.600
<b><i>but your heart can stand its own ground,
that it can.</i></b>

18:44.930 --> 18:46.180
<b><i>Against Miss Kaoru...</i></b>

18:46.810 --> 18:47.850
<b><i>or the townsfolk...</i></b>

18:48.480 --> 18:51.020
<b><i>not an inch of that blade will touch them!</i></b>

18:51.690 --> 18:54.690
<b><i>If you want an opponent,
I will take you on.</i></b>

18:56.150 --> 18:57.070
<b>Damn it.</b>

19:05.160 --> 19:09.750
<b><i>When you bring me no money,
you're absolutely worthless.</i></b>

19:15.710 --> 19:18.170
<b>KAMIYA KASSHIN
SCHOOL OF KENDO</b>

19:16.880 --> 19:18.170
<b>I'm home, that I am.</b>

19:29.440 --> 19:30.390
<b>That kiddo.</b>

19:31.190 --> 19:33.060
<b><i>I ain't no kid!</i></b>

19:33.060 --> 19:35.610
<b><i>I'm a descendant of a Tokyo samurai,
Yahiko Myojin!</i></b>

19:36.070 --> 19:39.360
<b><i>I haven't sunk so low
as to be pitied by others!</i></b>

19:42.240 --> 19:43.700
<b>If times hadn't changed,</b>

19:43.700 --> 19:47.160
<b>he would have been
one fine samurai when he grew up.</b>

20:15.730 --> 20:16.570
<b>Damn it.</b>

20:17.190 --> 20:18.650
<b>Yahiko.</b>

20:20.110 --> 20:25.070
<b>It's evening now.
Come on, cough up this month's payment.</b>

20:25.320 --> 20:27.030
<b>- I don't have it.
- Huh?</b>

20:27.240 --> 20:28.870
<b>I'm done being a pickpocket.</b>

20:28.870 --> 20:31.040
<b>I'm gonna cut all ties
with you yakuza folk, too.</b>

20:31.250 --> 20:33.120
<b>Huh? What are you talking abo—</b>

20:47.970 --> 20:50.220
<b>What do you mean by that?</b>

20:52.230 --> 20:54.190
<b>I don't mean anything else.</b>

20:57.400 --> 21:01.280
<b>I just got sick of something
so miserable as pickpocketing.</b>

21:04.570 --> 21:07.320
<b>I don't like you. You're too cheeky.</b>

21:07.660 --> 21:09.330
<b>This is as good an opportunity as any.</b>

21:09.740 --> 21:13.750
<b>I'll take my time and
show you just who is the master here.</b>

22:45.050 --> 22:50.050
<b>KASSHIN-RYU - REBORN</b>

22:46.050 --> 22:49.010
<b><i>Next episode: "Kasshin-ryu - Reborn."</i></b>
